{
 "items": [
  {
   "item": "dynamic",
   "verdict": "ok",
   "reason": "It asks why a quantity changed over ten years and what would change its path, not for a single number."
  },
  {
   "item": "horizon",
   "verdict": "weak",
   "reason": "It looks back ten years and forward to 2028, but does not say why 2028 is far enough for hiring and budget delays to play out."
  },
  {
   "item": "reference mode",
   "verdict": "weak",
   "reason": "It names the list but asks about the wait, and the data hold counts by time waited, not waiting times, so the measure to explain is unclear."
  },
  {
   "item": "decision maker",
   "verdict": "missing",
   "reason": "The statement does not say whose decision it serves; the chief operating officer appears only in the context."
  },
  {
   "item": "exclusions",
   "verdict": "missing",
   "reason": "Nothing is said about what is left out, such as individual specialties, emergency care or the private sector."
  }
 ],
 "claims": [
  {
   "claim": "The list more than doubled over the ten years.",
   "test": {
    "test": "ratio",
    "start": "2014-01",
    "end": "2023-12",
    "at_least": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "The list grew before the 2020 shock.",
   "test": {
    "test": "change",
    "series": "total",
    "start": "2014-01",
    "end": "2019-12",
    "expect": "up"
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "Growth before 2020 sped up rather than holding steady.",
   "test": {
    "test": "acceleration",
    "start": "2014-01",
    "end": "2019-12",
    "expect": "rising"
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "The list jumped between December 2019 and December 2021.",
   "test": {
    "test": "change",
    "series": "total",
    "start": "2019-12",
    "end": "2021-12",
    "expect": "up"
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "The list has been flat since the extra activity of 2022.",
   "test": {
    "test": "change",
    "series": "total",
    "start": "2022-01",
    "end": "2023-12",
    "expect": "flat"
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "The share waiting over a year rose before the shock.",
   "test": {
    "test": "change",
    "series": "share",
    "start": "2014-12",
    "end": "2019-12",
    "expect": "up"
   }
  },
  {
   "claim": "The share waiting over a year has kept rising since 2021.",
   "test": {
    "test": "change",
    "series": "share",
    "start": "2021-12",
    "end": "2023-12",
    "expect": "up"
   }
  }
 ],
 "rewrite": "Why has the outpatient waiting list more than doubled since 2014, and grown older, despite repeated extra activity, and which policies within the group's control would bring the share waiting over a year down by December 2028? The answer is for the chief operating officer; individual specialties, emergency care and private-sector capacity are outside the study."
}

